    "strokeColor": "#868e96"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "n2",
    "x": 60,
    "y": 730,
    "text": "Cursor's install command takes an arbitrary path, so it runs ai-coding/hooks/cloud-agent-bootstrap.sh straight from the source tree\nand needs no mirror. Claude Code discovers hooks by path inside .claude/, so make mirrors copies the adapter to .claude/hooks/ and\nsettings.json invokes that copy; the adapter then execs the bootstrap sitting beside it.",
    "fontSize": 16,
    "strokeColor": "#495057"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "n3",
    "x": 60,
    "y": 850,
    "text": "Guard: session-start.sh exits 0 unless CLAUDE_CODE_REMOTE=true, so a local Claude Code session on an already-provisioned machine\nnever apt-installs behind the developer's back; ./install.sh stays in charge there.",
    "fontSize": 16,
    "strokeColor": "#495057"
  }
